  "solution": "3 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 5 - 2 ÷ 4 + 9 × 3 = 0\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs :\n\nOption 1): + and -\n\n5 - 2 ÷ 4 + 9 × 3 = 0 ⇒ 5 + 2 ÷ 4 - 9 × 3 = 0\n\n5 + __**2 ÷ 4**__ - 9 × 3 = 0\n\n5 + 0.5 - __**9 × 3**__ = 0\n\n__**5 + 0.5**__ - 27 = 0\n\n__**5.5 - 27**__ = 0\n\n21.5 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): = and ×\n\n5 - 2 ÷ 4 + 9 × 3 = 0 ⇒ 5 - 2 ÷ 4 + 9 = 3 × 0\n\n5 - __**2 ÷ 4**__ + 9 = __**3 × 0**__\n\n__**5 + 9**__ - 0.5 = 0\n\n__**14 - 0.5**__ = 0\n\n13.5 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3): - and ÷\n\n5 - 2 ÷ 4 + 9 × 3 = 0 ⇒ 5 ÷ 2 - 4 + 9 × 3 = 0\n\n__**5 ÷ 2**__ - 4 + 9 × 3 = 0\n\n2.5 - 4 + __**9 × 3**__ = 0\n\n__**2.5 + 27**__ - 4 = 0\n\n__**29.5 - 4**__ = 0\n\n25.5 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4): × and ÷\n\n5 - 2 ÷ 4 + 9 × 3 = 0 ⇒ 5 - 2 × 4 + 9 ÷ 3 = 0\n\n5 - 2 × 4 + __**9 ÷ 3**__ = 0\n\n5 - __**2 × 4**__ + 3 = 0\n\n__**5 + 3**__ - 8 = 0\n\n__**8 - 8**__ = 0\n\n**0 = 0 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
